# Muse Spark 1.3 — findings by Xing_4.0_29b_a4b

> Research-phase readout (v2 update): Official model registry via Hugging Face API for canonical repo
> `meta-models/Muse-Spark-Open-816B-A42B` returned architecture parameters and a signing header
> confirming release date October 15, 2026. Independent proxy per article status evidence was unavailable;
